window.products.push({"id":244117,"name":"Extra Large Cotton Rope Basket KRUIO Collapsible Woven Laundry Basket with Handles for Laundry,Nursery,Toys,Towels,Blankets and Pillows Even More，Rope","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LQERugVUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose the KRUIO woven laundry basket？ Our woven laundry basket is made of 100% organic cotton, soft and strong, suitable for children and families Our woven laundry basket is made of 100% organic cotton, soft and strong, suitable for children and families The vegan leather handle ensures firmness and is easy to carry; Carefully designed dark bottom conceals dirt，will not easily become dirty and can be used for a long time The vegan leather handle ensures firmness and is easy to carry; Carefully designed dark bottom conceals dirt，will not easily become dirty and can be used for a long time Collapsible design, easy to move and store, improves portability Collapsible design, easy to move and store, improves portability Our cotton rope basket can be used for hamper, bath basket, closet organization, nursery bin, toy storage.It keeps your life clean and tidy and makes it easier and quicker to find what you want Our cotton rope basket can be used for hamper, bath basket, closet organization, nursery bin, toy storage.It keeps your life clean and tidy and makes it easier and quicker to find what you want Stylish design as a decorative container for living room, closet, floor, bathroom, bedroom，laundry and nursery；add styles for you Stylish design as a decorative container for living room, closet, floor, bathroom, bedroom，laundry and nursery；add styles for you 「KRUIO」 Are you still upset that you can't find what you want anywhere？Are you still freaking out about the toys, blankets, etc. You don't have anywhere to put them？At this point, you need something to help you sort and organize. That's KRUIO. KRUIO was founded by a newly married couple. When they welcomed their first baby, they prepared a lot of toys and baby products. How to classify these things and where to put them seemed to be a problem. Having a storage basket seems to solve the problem. This is why KRUIO was founded. KRUIO tries to create more practical products to make people's lives more convenient. We hope to provide a new way of life for everyone, so that everyone is full of love and passion for life Specifications Material:100% cotton woven thread rope Size:20\" x13\" Package Quantity: 1x woven laundry basket Please Note： Individual baskets can vary slightly from the images, as each one is handmade We've got you covered： If our woven laundry basket hasn't satisfied you for any reason, you will receive a full refund within 30 days.NO QUESTION ASKED","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LQERugVUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRUIO","source_asin":"B08T256VP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T256VP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T256VP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
