window.products.push({"id":244219,"name":"Misiki Cervical Memory Foam Pillow, Orthopedic Pillow Contour Pillow for Neck Pain, Cervical Ergonomic Pillow for Side Sleepers, Back and Stomach Slee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZG8B3A4rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Away From Neck and Shoulder Pain】THE MEMORY FOAM ITSELF MAY HAVE A VERY LIGHT SMELL, PLEASE VENTILABLE IT FOR 5-7 DAYS. This cervical pillow is made of high quality memory foam with moderate hardness to ensure a comfortable support while sleeping, relaxing the neck pain and shoulder stiffness. The memory foam with a temperature sensing function that makes the pillow fit your neck perfectly. 【Ergonomic Design】The butterfly-shaped contour neck pillow designed with cervical contour and central cavity to keep the neck bent naturally, properly support the neck and head, facilitate alignment of the head with the body and spine. The wedge extension part helps to support the thoracic. Special armrests of orthopedic pillows support the arms. 【Ideal Pillow for Back/Side Sleeping】Butterfly-shaped orthopedic pillows customized for back and side sleeping. When you sleep on your back, the natural traction of the neck and head support can reduce the pressure on the posterior skull, reduce snoring and improve sleep quality. When sleeping on the side, please sleep on the wing side, make sure the incision under the wing fits your shoulder curves, release the shoulder pressure, and place the arm on the armrests to reduce the numbness. 【Skin Friendly Pillowcase for Easy Cleaning】The ergonomic memory foam pillow equipment with a detachable pillowcase, made of 100% polyester fabric, friendly material, durable and resilient, easy to clean and keep hygiene. 【Perfect Care for the Cervical Vertebra】The neck support pillow is very suitable for the elders, officers, students, IT, and those who suffer from sleep disorders. If you have chronic cervical spondylosis, the delicate neck support pillow will be the optimum choice for providing a comfortable sleep and relieving pain of the cervical vertebra.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZG8B3A4rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Misiki","source_asin":"B08D38MQNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D38MQNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D38MQNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
