window.products.push({"id":244283,"name":"Royal Tradition Solid 600-Thread-Count, 100-Percent Cotton, Split-Top-California King 4PC Sheets Set for Adjustable Beds, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lChBSkleL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton - 600 Thread Count SLEEP COMFORTABLY ALL NIGHT LONG With Our Luxurious and Smooth 100% Cotton Sateen Bed Sheets Set, Woven at 600 Thread Count Per Square Inch- Single Yarn Ply Allowing these Sheets to be Softer than those of Double Yarn Ply. Our Customer Satisfaction is Guaranteed! SIZING & DIMENSIONS: Split Top California King Sheets set Includes: ONE Flat Sheet 110 Inches Wide X 102 Inches Long, ONE California King Fitted Sheet 72 Inches Wide X 84 Inches Long (Splitted at Top) with 6 Corner Pockets to Fit 18\" Deep Pocket Adjustable Mattress & TWO King Pillowcases 20 Inches Wide X 40 Inches Long each SHEETS & PILLOWCASES CONSTRUCTION: The Fitted Sheet is Fully Elasticized (Elastic All Around) for a Secure and Snug Fit and has Deep Pockets that Fit 15\" Deep Mattresses. The Flat Sheet and Pillowcases have 4 Inches Hemming & Piping Creating a Simple yet an Elegant Look SHEETS SET FEATURES: These Linens are Thick, Durable, Comfortable, Breathable and Absorbent Making Your Sleep Experience More Pleasant & Peaceful. Also, These Sheets Make a Great Gift for a Friend, Family Member or a Loved one to Show How Much You Care. The Bed Sheets Come in Solid Colors that Will Change the Atmosphere of Any Bedroom CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Pure Natural Cotton Fabric Tends to Wrinkle and Shrink in it's Nature! To Limit These Issues to the Minimum: Machine Wash in Cold Water on Delicate Cycle with Mild Detergent- No Bleach. Dry on Low Settings. We Highly Recommend to Put Your Sheets/Pillowcases on Your Bed/Pillows Right After Pulling Them Out of the Dryer. Also, Wash Sheets with Similar Linens, Don't Wash with Clothing that Have Metals or Rough Material Like Zippers (They Get Softer After Each Wash)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lChBSkleL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Tradition","source_asin":"B00WVTMYN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WVTMYN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WVTMYN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
