window.products.push({"id":244402,"name":"Peggy Karr Handcrafted Art Glass Tuscany Serving Bowl, Oval,16-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-NLKY+KQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Handmade in the USA by Peggy Karr Glass, this art glass serving bowl is both beautiful and practical - perfect for entertaining and as a stand-alone piece of art. The pattern - a cheerful yellow sunflower blossom surrounded by an olive-branch border - is actually embedded within the glass, not applied to the surface. Using a series of complex stencils, powdered enamel pigments are hand-applied between two layers of recycled glass and kiln-fired at over 1500F degrees. The process fuses the glass and pigments together, permanently sealing in the design and creating a unique character of bubbles and surface texture in the glass. The result is a gorgeous, durable, 100-percent food-safe serving piece that is microwave-warmable and dishwasher-safe. Due to its hand-crafted nature, each piece of Peggy Karr glass may vary in size. This oval bowl measures approximately 16 x 8 x 4-1/2-inch overall. The glass is untempered and therefore not for oven use; avoid contact with extremely hot food. Please note that use of harsh dishwashing detergents and hard water may cause clouding. Peggy Karr glass is highly collectible and available in a wide range of patterns and pieces. Peggy Karr Glass - functional art at its finest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-NLKY+KQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peggy Karr","source_asin":"B004QL7KOS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004QL7KOS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004QL7KOS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
