window.products.push({"id":244430,"name":"80mm/3.15\" Christmas Ball Ornaments - 9pcs Large Shatterproof Foam Christmas Tree Decorations, Clear Plastic Glitter Hanging Balls for Xmas Holiday Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ll87CVxCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Christmas Ball Ornaments - Adorn your Christmas Tree with this beautiful set of Ball Ornaments. Featuring four assorted designs, diamond foam balls paired with sparkling clear Christmas balls makes this set the perfect additiont to your holiday tree decor. Which can be used as gifts for friends to cherish, or you can display the ornaments on your own Christmas tree. Multiple Color Schemes - We have Christmas ball ornaments in a variety of beautiful colors to decorate your Christmas tree. Sparkling diamonds are added to the surface of the ball using delicate craftsmanship, adding an alluring luster. Select one or more of your favorite colors from our wide color selection to suit your holiday decor theme. Decorative Hanging Ornaments - 4 styles, 9 pcs unique designs with hanging loop allow you to easily decorate your Christmas tree while making your Christmas decorations for trees or others look more colorful and pretty. Add visual interest with seasonal scenes and bright colors to liven up Christmas decorations. Shatterproof Christmas Ornaments - These Christmas balls are made of high quality materials to provide excellent shatterproof performance without compromising on beauty.Which is the ideal Christmas decorations for a home with kids or pets. When children and pets play around a Christmas tree full of exquisite Christmas ball ornaments, it looks so warm. Wide Application - Add winter elegance to your Christmas decorations with this beautiful set. Which is Great choice for Christmas, weddings, engagements, anniversaries, and also for home, school, receptions, shops and shopping malls. Also perfect for Christmas themed craft DIY items. These Christmas balls will add sparkle to your holiday decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ll87CVxCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Krisdecor","source_asin":"B09Y59LZBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y59LZBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y59LZBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
