window.products.push({"id":244525,"name":"Metrokane 4-Piece Wine Tool Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D0S7Q77ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A great gift for any host, the 4-pc. Velvet Corkscrew Wine Tool Kit has everything you need to start the wine flowing. The foil cutter removes the foil cap with a simple squeeze, and the corkscrew features an extra-long spiral that makes pulling out the cork easy. A drip-stop ring slips on any size bottle to prevent trickles and stains, and a wine/champagne stopper keeps an airtight seal on leftovers. Each tool has a velvety, rubberized finish that makes them comfortable to grip. Comes in an attractive plastic case, ready for gift-giving. Imported. Amazon.com Clad in a black matte-finish that feels like velvet and provides a sure grip even when wet, the handsome tools in this four-piece kit equip a bar or dining room with all the essentials for opening, pouring, and storing wine. The foil cutter neatly removes a wine bottle's foil cap. The corkscrew pulls out a cork effortlessly. The drip-stop ring slips onto a bottle's neck to spare table linens and guests' clothes. The stopper seals in champagne bubbles or protects a still wine from oxidation with a twist of its top. All four tools fit into slots in an 8-by-7-1/4-inch storage case that can either stand upright or lie on the bar, in a cabinet, or in a drawer. The case's transparent lid flips open at a touch for instant access. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D0S7Q77ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Metrokane","source_asin":"B00005M07S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005M07S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005M07S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":244526,"name":"MASTER FENG Kitchen Grater, Cheese Grater 5 High-efficiency Vegetable Slicer With Interchangeable Round Stainless Steel Blades, Suitable For Fruits, V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AyWZFmEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECTION DESIGN - The Rotary cheese cutter comes out of a designated window which can be collected into the bowl, with a large capacity can grate a larger amount of food at a time. Extra comes with a separate part which holds down the contents of the hopper also keeping your fingers away from the blade. HIGH EFFICIENT - with our rotary drum grater, you can get food preparation more efficiently with minimum effort, which could up to 10x faster cutting speed than cutter by hands. 360 degree blades cuts foods all the time when you crank the handle. VERSATILE USE - this vegetable slicer come with 5 different drums blades, which is great for cheese, vegetables, potatoes, nuts, onions, chocolate for coleslaw, hash browns, salad, pizza toppings and more. You can vary the food fineness via use of different blades to grate cheese, vegetables, nuts, etc. EASY ASSEMBLE USE - Adopt countertop design and suction base to securely hold the grater onto the surface preventing it from slipping or toppling over. Gives a more stabilized, and mess-free kitchen working environment. STURDY & DISHWASHER SAFE - Made of stainless steel which is resistant to rust and corrosion, durable and sturdy. The vegetable cutter parts can be taken apart easily, it's safe to be washed in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AyWZFmEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASTER FENG","source_asin":"B09N8W35X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8W35X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8W35X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
