window.products.push({"id":244645,"name":"Margaritaville Village Flip Flop Repair Shop Lit Building, 8.5\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SMx9n3F4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Just in case you step on the pop top or anything else that causes a flip flop blowout, come on down to the Flip Flop Repair Shop. They’ll get you fixed up in a jiffy. Forgot to bring a pair on vacation to Margarita Ville? No worries, they have them all! About Department 56: Over thirty years ago, Department 56 began as part of Bachman's, a premiere retail florist in Minneapolis. Bachman's used a numbering system to identify each of its departments. The number assigned to wholesale gift imports division was, you guessed it, 56. Now headquartered in Eden Prairie, Minnesota, Department 56 has become a leader in the giftware, collectibles and holiday decorating industry and is best known for our hand-crafted lighted villages, Snow babies figurines and extensive lines of holiday and home decorative products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SMx9n3F4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Margaritaville","source_asin":"B0792596LF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0792596LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0792596LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
