window.products.push({"id":244707,"name":"Crincefee 53mm Espresso Tamper Coffee Tamper, Stainless Steel Espresso Base Tamper Compatible with Espresso Machine Rancilio, Gaggia Bottomless Portaf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wrF9FcG+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Adjustable Depth】: The depth of espresso tamper is not only adjustable but can be more accurate through the scale to fit filter baskets of any depth. Its adjustment range is 4mm ~ 13mm, you can fine-tune according to the thickness of coffee powder, coffee variety, baking degree, etc. ☕【New Upgrade Tamping Pressure】: This espresso press tamper has been upgraded with a constant block, which can completely solve the problem of pressure deviation in the process of pressing coffee powder. For perfectionists who demand the best possible tasting espresso shot, our calibrated tamper ensures you get a 100% PERFECT TAMP EVERY TIME. The perfect tamp for the best tasting espresso possible. ☕【Unique Design Handle】: It is a spring loaded tamper and does not require additional adjustments. It has an ergonomic handle with a comfortable grip that allows you to push ground coffee easily. The base is made of a 304 stainless steel. ☕【Multi Size | Color】: To reach you get the best shopping experience, we offer a variety of sizes such as 51mm, 53mm, 58 mm tamper and two colors, like silver and black compatible with different sizes of flat bottomless portafilter. (Note: for a 53 or 54 mm portafilter, you need to choose 53 mm calibrated tamper.） ☕【High Quality Material】: Made of 100% food-safe grade stainless steel for the tamper base. Compared with other cheaper espresso tamper machines, this stainless steel base tamper is a sturdy and healthy tamper tool for Baristas. The handle of coffee hand tamper is durable and rust-proof design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wrF9FcG+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crincefee","source_asin":"B0BK9WRRSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK9WRRSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK9WRRSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":244708,"name":"Fermentation Kit Premium Pack - 4 Fermenting Lids, 4 Fermentation Glass Weights With Easy Grip Holder, Fermenting Packer, Pump, Easy Fermenter Wide Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PInjwCVJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With wide mouth lid, pump, heavy weight, strong pounder, galahome fermentation lid kit enables both new beginner and skilled fermenter to make delicious probiotic food. √ Pounder: Break Down Tough Veggies and Squeeze Out Liquid Some veggies have firm consistency and tough surface require a pounder to break them down. Squeezing out liquid and tenderizing accelerate the process of fermentation, while veggies are compressed to stay under the brine at the same time, making them isolate the air. √ Lids: Eliminate Troubles of Air Exposure and Exploding The waterless airlock valve allows carbon dioxide to escape and prevents oxygen entering at the same time. Users do not have to open the lid to burp anymore. √ Weight: Keep Ingredients Totally Submerged to Get Ideal Ferment Result galahome glass weights never absorbs food odors or colors. They are thick and heavy enough to keep veggies submerged in the brine liquid and maintaining no oxygen exposure condition during fermentation process. The easy grip handle allows to take out the weight from jar easily. √ Pump: Extract Air to Reduce the Risk of Air Exposure In the later stage of fermentation when you open the jar to try your batch, oxygen will enter and ruin the anaerobic environment, so we need to extract oxygen out. Erect the pump on the valve and pull with double actions- both upstroke and downstroke to suck out air from the jar. Double actions make air extraction effortless. √ Pickle Your Favorite Veggies Simply Step 1- Pack ingredients into a mason jar. Then pour brine. Step 2- Lay a weight on veggies, leaving 1 to 2 inches space from brine to top. Step 3- Cover the jar with lid tightly let it ferment. Mark the beginning date by the date indicator. Step 4- Use the pump to extract oxygen in the later fermentation stage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PInjwCVJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"galahome","source_asin":"B07CHHRYGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHHRYGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHHRYGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
