window.products.push({"id":244730,"name":"monbento Mb Kawaii Egg Molds (Pack of 2), One Size, Fushia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kZELVbloL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The pair of MB Kawaii square egg moulds is so original. Immerse yourself in Japanese culture with the MB Kawaii and bring a touch of Japan to your bento boxes with homemade square eggs. The two small inscriptions appear on the moulds to make these accessories even cuter!  Nothing could be easier than to maintain these egg moulds : MB Kawaii is dishwasher safe. SAFE MB Kawaii moulds are guaranteed without BPA* or BPS, offering you a bento mould that’s perfectly safe. * in accordance with the regulations REUSABLE To guarantee their resistance MB Kawaii egg moulds are made of PP, a highly resistant and easily recyclable plastic. METHOD Peel hot hard-boiled eggs and place them in the mould. Immerse the mould in a bowl of cold water or in the refrigerator. Wait ten minutes, then remove the boiled egg from the mould.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kZELVbloL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"monbento","source_asin":"B009G1VV7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009G1VV7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009G1VV7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
