window.products.push({"id":244786,"name":"Whiskey Decanter Set,Globe Decanter,Whiskey Gifts for Men Husband Him Boyfriend Dad Women,with 2 Glasses,Beads,4 Ice Cubes,Tong & Funnel,Beverage Drin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+LhwyBOGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[PREMIUM QUALITY] - The elegant whiskey decanter set is made from 100% high-quality, fully hand blown, lead-free crystal. It is beautiful, durable and safe to use every day. [HIGH-QUALITY REUSABLE WHISKEY STONES (INCLUDED)] - The whiskey decanter package includes four stainless-steel reusable whiskey stones along with a stainless-steel ice tong. This product is made of 304-Stainless-Steel and frozen liquid, which freezes faster and longer than other whiskey \"ice stones\" with a freezing speed 10 times faster than other \"ice stones\". And it will not affect the original taste of the whiskey. [CLEANING BEADS FOR EASY CLEANING] -The package includes a box of stainless-steel cleaning beads for easy and effective cleaning. You can clean the whiskey dispenser quickly by pouring the beads into the dispenser with water and detergent and shaking it. A pouring strainer is also included, which allows you to pour the beads out without scattering them all over. [UNIQUE DESIGN] - This glass decanter set featuring an etched globe design and antique ship in the bottle will undoubtedly enhance your drinking experience while making a bold impression. [9-IN-1 SET] - Our globe whiskey decanter comes with an antique ship decanter (850ml) / 2 world map etched glasses (230ml) / elegant wooden stand / a box of 4-pack stainless steel whiskey stones & clamps / a box of beads / bottle stopper/pouring strainer and funnel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+LhwyBOGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHIGOO","source_asin":"B07Z33XVSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z33XVSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z33XVSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
