window.products.push({"id":244789,"name":"Tea Kettle, Chinese Red Cast Iron Teapot with Stainless Steel Infuser Stovetop Safe, Durable Small Teapot Coated with Enameled Interior(700ml)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zmpk6OJYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【CAST IRON TEAPOT】 Cast iron teapot can be used to boil water as tea kettle. It also can be used to make tea or boil tea as teapot. Teapot full-load capacity: 700ml/23.7oz, Recommend boiling capacity: 500ml/16.9oz，or less. Serve for 1-3 people, 2-3 cups when the teapot is full-load. The cast iron teapot can improve water quality and replenish the iron element to human body. 【WONDERFUL DESIGN】Cast iron teapot is with horizontal stripe pattern of the Japanese iron kettle on the surface. It is the necessary decoration to any kitchen.It is a masterful collection for tea lovers. Cast iron teapot could break down the element of Fe2+, which is beneficial to your body. Cast iron teapot also has long heat preservation. So the water after boiled by our cast iron teapot can be more sweeter and softer, which is suitable for all kinds of tea making or other drinks making. 【PERFECT GIFT】An exquisite gift for Dad, Mom, Friends, Family, Wedding, Decorations, Party and Tea Lovers. Cast iron teapot let your drink water be healthy. Cast iron teapot can improve the water quality by releasing iron ions and absorbing chloride ions in water. 【SAFE MATERIAL】The cast iron teapot material is sturdy and protects the teapot from being damaged easily, which greatly extend the life of teapot. The fully enameled interior helps preserve the taste of the tea original and pure also can allow for easy care. Rest assured that it's safe and healthy to be with no chemical additives or lead. 【GUARANTEE】 YJX cast iron teapot is professionally crafted by skilled craftsmen. Quality is the life of our teapot. If you are not satisfied with our product,just contact us through Amazon Email and we will solve your all issues to meet your 100% satisfaction. You can also return it for a full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zmpk6OJYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YJX","source_asin":"B0888ST9MV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0888ST9MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0888ST9MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
