window.products.push({"id":244837,"name":"Cheer Collection Chunky Cable Knit Throw Blanket for Couch, Sofa, Bedroom and Living Room - Extra Soft and Cozy Decorative Throws - 50\" x 60\", Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iAi4eyeoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUS SOFTNESS: The unbelievably soft woven texture on our throw blankets act as perfect decorative accents for any piece of furniture in any room of your home or business. Our decorative blankets are designed to look and feel like a hand knit throw just like your favorite sweater. The perfect cuddle companion for chilly summer nights and brisk winter months, our chunky knit blanket brings style, comfort, and warmth to anyone's residence. QUALITY MATERIALS: Our knitted blankets & throws are constructed of deeply plush acrylic material for an ultra cozy, warm, and lightweight design ideal for use all season long. Our chunky knit throw is large enough to wrap you in a relaxing and comforting cocoon for the ultimate snuggly rest. GORGEOUS GIFT: Our oversized throw blankets truly make great gifts for any and all occasions, or even simply just because! Watch the smile form on that special someone's face when they open the present of this chunky throw! Give the gift of warming comfort with out knit throw blanket great for birthdays, holidays, or any special occasion. Men and women alike love our knit throw blankets! TIMELESS DECOR: Our chunky throw blanket looks simply amazing in any living space. Toss on a bed, couch, sofa, or anywhere for a chic look sure to impress both friends and family. Our extra large blanket throws are sure to be the star of the show in any room. SNUGGLE TIME JUST GOT BETTER: Our warm and big throw blanket is lightweight enough to make for the perfect cuddle buddy anytime you desire comforting softness and warmth. Our ultra soft blankets feel immaculate to the touch. For the best blanket you've ever nestled with, give our large knit blanket a try and experience the difference!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iAi4eyeoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheer Collection","source_asin":"B07GSGXP6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSGXP6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSGXP6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
