window.products.push({"id":244874,"name":"Bonsenkitchen 3 in 1 Capsule Coffee Maker, Mini Capsule Coffee Machine Compatible with Ground Coffee, Auto Shut Off & Self-Cleaning Function","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o3vzOgjhL._AC_SL1439_.jpg","description":"3 in 1 Capsule Coffee Machine -- The single cup coffee machine compatible with espresso and ground coffee. With our multi-function coffee maker, you can choose your favorite coffee style and enjoy the rich aroma of espresso, cappuccino and latte. Easy to Use -- One Touch operation makes it easy to enjoy a cup of high quality coffee just 1 minute on busy mornings. 7 levels of water volume you can choose. Follow the instructions for the recommended amount of water to make coffee just the way you want. Auto Shut Off & Stable Base -- Our coffee maker will automatically shut off after 9 minutes of not being in use, safe and save energy. There are 4 suction cups at bottom, very stable to place on kitchen countertops or office tables. The coffee machine is not easy to flip over, don't worry about safety. Self-Cleaning Function -- Fill water tank and press the brewing buttons after finish making coffee, it will automatically clean itself. Don't worry about stains remaining inside machine, every cup of your coffee maintains its original flavor. Avoid the hassle and clutter associated with traditional coffee machines. The removable drip tray is dishwasher safe. Mini Size and 1L Water Tank -- The size of coffee maker is 11*9*4inch, perfect for home, office, hotel, apartment, camping, etc. Especially for limited counter space or when you travel, you can take it anywhere. Enjoy a hot coffee anytime! 1L water tank allows you to enjoy coffee without adding water frequently. DESIGNED FOR USE IN THE US, NO NEED ADAPTER OR CONVERTER","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o3vzOgjhL._AC_SL1439_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonsenkitchen","source_asin":"B09DY97T5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DY97T5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DY97T5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
