window.products.push({"id":244949,"name":"VSUDO Window Privacy Film, Decorative Stained Glass Window Film, Frosted Window Tinting Film for Home, House Door Glass Window Tint Coverings Film, St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iqlPG1Q5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"VSUDO decorative window film can protect our privacy and keep the room still bright by natural sunshine. The privacy window sticker blocks out most UV and soften strong sunlight. It is a best privacy protecting alternative solution to heavy curtains and blinds. Where to use VSUDO window film? We can use this window covering film in living/sitting/kids/washing/dinning/dressing/guest/front/kitchen/study/game room, houseroom, bathroom, bedroom, cloakroom, coatroom, classroom, parlour/parlor, attic, patio, balcony, basement, lounge, garage, side/laundry/locker/waiting/changing room, tearoom, checkroom, washhouse, restroom, meeting room. Stick them on front door edge window, storm door window, sliding door window, French window, cabinet panel glass. This frost window films fit for office, apartment, house, toilet, trailer, mobile/men/lady room, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Tips: 1. This window film is only suitable for smooth, flat clean glass surface. Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials.2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying, otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. Sometime you will find it is difficult to tear off the protective film, you can try to tape the two sides of film corner with adhesive tape then peel off.3. Pay attention to the difference between the front and the back of the film. Be sure to stick the smooth surface on the glass, otherwise it will not stick firmly or even fall off. 4. This film uses electrostatic technology, no glue. Before application, just spray enough water on the glass surface. If the paste is not firm, it may be the cause of insufficient water. You can tear the product off, much more water and paste it again. 5. This window film screen can show the colors when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iqlPG1Q5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B07V1SRGZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-244949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V1SRGZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V1SRGZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
